  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n## 2026-09-11 - 10.0.0.3\n\n- Aligned transaction FIFO routing with the legacy `EnableFifoTransaction` environment-variable behavior.\n- Registered SNS topic settings as part of the core AWS service registration.\n- Removed temporary SNS and SQS diagnostic logging.\n- Added structured diagnostics for transaction SNS FIFO routing and audit SQS publishing.\n\n\n\n## 2026-08-24 - 10.0.0.2\n- Dotnet 10 migration and updated github action.\n\n## 2026-08-14 - 10.0.0.1\n\n-  Published the Stable .net 10 compatible version\n\n##  2026-08-20 - 8.0.0.8\n\n- Registered the shared keyed cache service with its required structured logger.",
